      "english": "2018-07-20 Rain"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "今天，我们中文考试的成绩出来了。",
      "traditional": "今天，我們中文考試的成績出來了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ men zhōng wén kǎo shì de chéng jì chū lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我得了86分，满分是100分。",
      "traditional": "我得了86分，滿分是100分。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ dé le 3 fēn mǎn fēn shì 2 fēn",
      "english": "Today our Chinese exam results came out."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "因为我们班的平均分是78分，所以我觉得我考得还不错。",
      "traditional": "因為我們班的平均分是78分，所以我覺得我考得還不錯。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wǒ men bān de píng jūn fēn shì 3 fēn suǒ yǐ wǒ jué de wǒ kǎo de hái bú cuò",
      "english": "I got 86 points out of 100."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "露西不是很高兴，因为她只得了70分。",
      "traditional": "露西不是很高興，因為她只得了70分。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī bú shì hěn gāo xìng yīn wèi tā zhǐ dé le 2 fēn",
      "english": "Since our class average was 78 points, I think I did quite alright."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "麦克很高兴，因为他考得非常好，他得了95分，是全班最高分。",
      "traditional": "麥克很高興，因為他考得非常好，他得了95分，是全班最高分。",
      "pinyin": "mài kè hěn gāo xìng yīn wèi tā kǎo de fēi cháng hǎo tā dé le 3 fēn shì quán bān zuì gāo fēn",
      "english": "Lucy wasn’t too happy, because she only got 70 points."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mike was very happy, since he did very well. He got 95 points, which was the top score in our class."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我要好好学习，下次我要考全班第一名。",
      "traditional": "我要好好學習，下次我要考全班第一名。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào hǎo hǎo xué xí xià cì wǒ yào kǎo quán bān dì yī míng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I have to study diligently. Next time I want to be number one in our class."
    }
  ],
